# Top-level pins for the picture-gen Lambda (Phase 42b), on top of api/requirements.txt. Not installed directly: the
# build installs api/requirements-picture-gen.txt, the hash-pinned lock generated from this file and requirements.txt
# by `python3 scripts/build_lambdas.py --lock picture_gen` (backlog B-4). Change a pin here, regenerate, commit both.
# The bedrock extra brings boto3 and botocore, so the SDK's AWS signing runs on the botocore it was locked with
# (the same version as requirements-dev.txt), not whatever the python3.14 runtime ships.
anthropic[bedrock]==2.8.0
